#: ../../tools/mavedb_tools.rst:63 97e560f234e841c7aafd344bcfc0ce89
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get functional variant effect scores from a MaveDB score"
" set. Returns HGVS-annotated variants with their functional scores from "
"deep mutational scanning or other MAVE assays. Scores indicate variant "
"effect on protein function (interpretation depends on the specific assay "
"- check score set metadata). Optionally filter by HGVS protein notation "
"(e.g., 'Arg175' to find all R175 substitutions)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mavedb_tools.rst:67 f9b21e8f1dba485292d3ed781ca8fe0d
msgid ""
"``urn`` (string) (required) MaveDB score set URN (e.g., "
"'urn:mavedb:00001234-c-1'). Obtain from MaveDB\\_search\\_score\\_sets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mavedb_tools.rst:70 a39bc189a8bc49f1b6cfeac82687e232
msgid ""
"``hgvs_pro`` (string) (optional) Optional filter: HGVS protein notation "
"substring (e.g., 'Arg175', 'p.Arg175His'). Case-insensitive partial match"
" on protein-level HGVS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mavedb_tools.rst:73 3042005cda344fa3809b05371c20b5ac
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum variants to return (default 50, "
"max 500)."
msgstr ""

